":"同在洛杉矶E3期间，太阳月亮情报"},{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-7558415","kind":"continues","label":"同一系列的前后篇","title":"【活动】2016伦敦宝可梦媒体之旅","url":"/gamefreak-director/lineblog-7558415/","why":"同为太阳月亮媒体巡回行程记录"}],"sources":{"pokemon_names":"2026-09-23","tour_places":"2026-09-23","model":"deepseek-chat","relations_model":"deepseek-chat"},"built":"2026-09-25","edited":false,"by_seg":{"42":{"dex":[113]},"0":{"people":["masuda-junichi"],"obs":0},"13":{"works":["宝可梦 太阳・月亮"],"obs":1},"2":{"places":["游戏店"]},"47":{"places":["GameStop"]},"39":{"places":["好莱坞标志"]}}},"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"洛杉矶短暂自由时间里，他没能观光，却逛了两家游戏店，还发现《宝可梦 太阳・月亮》已经开始接受预订。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">这次</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">没时间观光（笑）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">不过</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">想去的是……</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/001-15a1759895.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/001-15a1759895.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n游戏店（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/002-461a0d5edd.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/002-461a0d5edd.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n宝可梦游戏\n摆了好多！\n感觉好开心！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n宝可梦 太阳・月亮\n已经开始接受预订了！\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/003-bfddafff15.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/003-bfddafff15.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n哇——！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n走出店门后……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n景色真令人心情舒畅！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/004-7b8fd140ba.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/004-7b8fd140ba.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n咦？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n仔细一看……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/005-1dedee7d68.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/005-1dedee7d68.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"506\" height=\"650\"></a></figure>\n\n好莱坞标志！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n吉利蛋！\n感觉就像观光过了一样（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n又一家 GameStop 里\n居然有这种东西！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/006-934b05046e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/006-934b05046e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n毫不犹豫就买下来了（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n自由时间到此结束！\n虽然只是去了两家游戏店\n但玩得很开心！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">今回は</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">観光できる時間がない（笑）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">でも</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">行きたかったのが・・・</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/001-15a1759895.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/001-15a1759895.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nゲーム屋さん（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/002-461a0d5edd.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/002-461a0d5edd.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nポケモンソフトが\nたくさん置かれてた！\nなんか嬉しい！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nもう\nポケモン サン・ムーンの予約が\n開始されてたよ！\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/003-bfddafff15.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/003-bfddafff15.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nおおー！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n店を出ると・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n気持ち良い景色！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/004-7b8fd140ba.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/004-7b8fd140ba.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nん？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nよく見ると・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/005-1dedee7d68.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/005-1dedee7d68.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"506\" height=\"650\"></a></figure>\n\nハリウッドサインが！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nラッキー！\n観光した気分（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nもう1件のゲームストップには\nこんなものが！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/006-934b05046e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4229496/006-934b05046e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n迷わず買ったよ（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこれで自由時間終了！\n2件のゲーム屋さんに行っただけだけど\n楽しかった！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！</div>"}}